                <pb facs="1099" n="949" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg949"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3714/4.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Shah of Persia to the President of the United
                        States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic">January 11,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am deeply touched by the amiable sentiments contained in Your Excellency’s
                    telegram and express to you my most sincere thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mohammed Ali.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
